            + 3 * MemoryLayout<EraseSchema2ColdAuxiliaryPhysicalRosterV1.Tree>.stride
            + 3 * MemoryLayout<[EraseSchema2ColdAuxiliaryPhysicalRosterV1.Node]>.stride
            + 4 * MemoryLayout<TemporalPolicyObservationV1>.stride
